[{"title":"平山堂","author":"玄烨","text":"宛转平冈路向西，山堂遗构白云低。\n帘前冬暖花仍发，檐外风高鸟乱啼。\n仙仗何尝惊野梦，鸣镳偶尔过幽栖。\n文章太守心偏忆，墨洒龙香壁上题。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36931,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"天宁寺","author":"玄烨","text":"小艇沿流画桨轻，鹿园钟磬有馀清。\n门前一带䢴沟水，脉脉常含万古情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36932,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"由仪真乘巨舰至京口","author":"玄烨","text":"长江万里开鸿濛，高樯巨楫乘艨艟。\n仪真京口路百里，挂帆瞬息凌长风。\n汀芦洲树看历历，波恬浪阔光瀜瀜。\n遄流直下入沧海，远源上与岷峨通。\n山川断续合云雾，日月照耀浮虚空。\n舟行迅速疾飞驶，恍闻击鼓冯夷宫。\n柂楼高据极观眺，奇纵豁达舒心胸。\n年来江汉罢桴鼓，河海清宴绝战攻。\n舳舻閒系沙岸侧，水师捲甲悬长弓。\n羽葆南巡渡扬子，居安更念艰难功。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36933,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金山","author":"玄烨","text":"一览江天胜，东南势尽收。\n帆樯来极浦，台榭起中流。\n路出丹崖上，烟同碧汉浮。\n登临豁心目，浩荡俯沧洲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36934,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"试中泠泉","author":"玄烨","text":"缓酌中泠水，曾传第一泉。\n如能作霖雨，沾洒遍山川。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36935,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"妙高台","author":"玄烨","text":"台高绝众鸟，临眺畅清襟。\n渺渺沙洲树，青青远岸岑。\n波涛岩下接，洞壑槛边深。\n江水明如镜，弥徵天地心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36936,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"铁瓮城","author":"玄烨","text":"万里晴江拥舳舻，城高铁瓮接康衢。\n遗铭欲探华阳迹，旧宅难寻海岳图。\n半面烟岚雄北固，一方形势控东吴。\n龙舟漫道巡行盛，多恐深居政未敷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36937,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"竹林禅院在润州城南竹径数里","author":"玄烨","text":"一径入深竹，数里来上方。\n丛生岩磴密，枝拂云烟长。\n华旗出林际，芝盖停三阳。\n飒飒吹霜风，碧叶纷翱翔。\n山斋颇幽寂，万籁含虚光。\n触物感予怀，歌彼淇澳章。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36938,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜过丹阳","author":"玄烨","text":"锦缆徐牵夜未停，遥天烟霭淡疏星。\n居人两岸明灯火，早是轻帆过驿亭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36939,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"途中览皇太子仿书以示之","author":"玄烨","text":"奎文一画开天象，保氏先教识六书。\n笔势须知贵严正，好将功力足三馀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36940,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"锡山","author":"玄烨","text":"朝游惠山寺，閒饮惠山泉。\n漱石流仍洁，分池溜自圆。\n松间幽径辟，岩下小亭悬。\n聊共群工濯，天真本浩然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36941,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吴阊","author":"玄烨","text":"鸣銮独上高城望，巷陌遥通水寺斜。\n土俗惟知斗歌舞，闾阎不解种桑麻。\n鸟啼茂苑千年树，霜冷吴宫十月花。\n声教四方犹未讫，愿将淳朴变繁华。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36942,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虎邱","author":"玄烨","text":"小阜回冈落照红，长廊曲榭构西东。\n独怜剑石潺湲水，霸业销沉在此中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36943,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"句容道上","author":"玄烨","text":"渐入茅山境，来当农暇时。\n但看初日上，未觉朔风吹。\n碧敛寒塘水，红垂野树枝。\n江南经几郡，民俗欲周知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36944,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨花台","author":"玄烨","text":"何地飞花雨，晴空无片云。\n江山恣遐瞩，草树出清芬。\n城郭参差见，楼台远近分。\n人家百万户，烟火尽氤氲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36945,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"幸报恩寺","author":"玄烨","text":"凤刹高悬上界灯，珠缸璧带一层层。\n平临下见诸天小，晴日江山万里澄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36946,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"驻跸金陵以方物寄献两宫","author":"玄烨","text":"深宫违定省，经月恋晨昏。\n率土方为养，苍生共戴尊。\n题书千里重，托物寸心存。\n遣使旌门外，踟蹰望九阍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36947,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金陵旧紫禁城怀古","author":"玄烨","text":"秣陵旧是图王地，此日鸾旗列队过。\n一代规模成往迹，六朝兴废逐流波。\n宫墙断缺迷青琐，野水湾环剩玉河。\n治理艰勤重殷鉴，斜阳衰草系情多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36948,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江宁驻跸皇太子启至请安兼报读完四书","author":"玄烨","text":"先圣有庭训，所闻在诗礼。\n虽然国与家，为学无二理。\n昨者来江东，相距三千里。\n迢遥蓟北云，念之不能已。\n凌晨发邮筒，开缄字满纸。\n语语皆天真，读书毕四子。\n龆年识进修，兹意良足喜。\n还宜日就将，无令有间止。\n大禹惜寸阴，今当重分晷。\n披卷慕古人，即事探奥旨。\n久久悦汝心，自得刍豢美。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36949,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"示江南大小诸吏","author":"玄烨","text":"东南财赋地，江左人文薮。\n时巡历此疆，民事日探剖。\n风俗贵淳庞，纷奢讵能久。\n澄清属大吏，表率群僚首。\n郡县布慈和，恺悌歌父母。\n民者国之本，生计在畎亩。\n六府既孔修，三事安可后。\n教化默转移，各须尽官守。\n户使敦诗书，人知崇孝友。\n庶几远迩氓，皞皞登仁寿。\n诰诫申予怀，斯言慎不负。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36950,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"燕子矶夜泊","author":"玄烨","text":"巍峨一片江头石，千载人传燕子矶。\n疑有鼋鼍藏窟宅，时闻钟磬出山扉。\n牙樯缓住寒烟净，羽卫周连夜火围。\n沙岸声声动行漏，芦花深处雁惊飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36951,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"高邮湖见居民田庐多在水中因询其故恻然念之","author":"玄烨","text":"淮扬罹水灾，流波常浩浩。\n龙舰偶经过，一望类洲岛。\n田亩尽沉沦，舍庐半倾倒。\n㷀㷀赤子民，栖栖卧深潦。\n对之心惕然，无策施襁褓。\n夹岸罗黔黎，跽陈进耆老。\n?诹不厌频，利弊细探讨。\n饥寒或有由，良惭奉苍颢。\n古人念一夫，何况睹枯槁。\n凛凛夜不寐，忧勤惄如捣。\n亟图浚治功，拯济须及早。\n会当复故业，咸令乐怀保。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36952,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阅河堤作","author":"玄烨","text":"防河纡旰食，六御出深宫。\n缓辔求民隐，临流叹俗穷。\n何年乐稼穑，此日是疏通。\n已著勤劳意，安澜早奏功。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36953,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泉林寺即子在川上处","author":"玄烨","text":"偶从川上驻行旃，密树重林带野烟。\n俯仰古今成一辙，源泉昼夜尚涓涓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36954,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"途中长至","author":"玄烨","text":"旌门已报黄钟节，六琯葭飞律未残。\n叆叆占云书太史，玱玱执玉忆郊坛。\n阳升一线宫中日，冰合重渊野外寒。\n景福重闱应有庆，晴光捧处是长安。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36955,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阙里古桧","author":"玄烨","text":"干耸朱甍外，根蟠碧殿阿。\n奇文成左纽，元气挺孤柯。\n瑞与龟龙并，传来岁月多。\n徘徊看手泽，不共劫灰磨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36956,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚到河间太皇太后使人送乳饼食物","author":"玄烨","text":"綵斿晚驻瀛州道，忽报铜龙骑使来。\n心识慈怀同日照，口传温语逐阳回。\n松脂似截盘中玉，绮食初和鼎内梅。\n两月几虚甘旨奉，归程欲听晓钟催。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36957,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"巡幸回宫内殿进讲毛诗","author":"玄烨","text":"丹甍绣户拂寒霜，静读毛诗意觉长。\n讨论一言穷六义，道心少悟爱斜阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36958,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"原任总督于成龙居官清廉自古罕有特命诸臣议恤以励官方","author":"玄烨","text":"服官敦廉隅，抗志贵孤洁。\n扬历著贤声，谁能茹荼檗。\n况复拥旌麾，藜藿甘以悦。\n视彼悬鱼操，于今尤峻烈。\n东南失保釐，言念心如结。\n江上见甘棠，遗爱舆人说。\n恤典宜优崇，庶不负清节。\n匪独彰国常，且以风在列。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36959,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蓟城遇雪","author":"玄烨","text":"冻云封树蓟城西，玉蕊轻盈乱马蹄。\n忆想年年常过此，何曾瑞雪遍山溪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36960,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读左氏春秋作","author":"玄烨","text":"夫子维王道，褒诛汗简青。\n千秋师凤德，三传翼麟经。\n义理资参校，丹铅彻昼冥。\n静中欣悟入，古训是新铭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36961,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"季夏游西山忆旧","author":"玄烨","text":"寻芳踏绿野，万紫迷深溪。\n地远峰头阔，山高水势低。\n飞花疑旧梦，烟柳促新题。\n沙暖鸳鸯睡，萋萋草满堤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36962,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏花","author":"玄烨","text":"奇蕊琼葩缀碧枝，幽香独占美丰姿。\n薰风初到窗前赏，疑是仙花月下移。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36963,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苦热戏作","author":"玄烨","text":"数年不见歊蒸热，于今炽日最难当。\n披襟气蹙三庚远，近榻神昏九夏长。\n烦暑时侵高阁上，炎光每到小楼傍。\n微凉须动清风扇，勉力勤民阅奏章。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36964,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨中远望","author":"玄烨","text":"庭槐开御幄，云气逼遥岑。\n雨湿銮铃重，风吹辇路深。\n芭蕉分碧叶，䓿萏荐香林。\n极目天边望，斜阳半岭阴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36965,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初秋","author":"玄烨","text":"大火初收暑气残，金风吹动芰荷寒。\n鸣蝉送夏声声急，雨霁遥天万里看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36966,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中元日蕉园作","author":"玄烨","text":"中元来太液，新爽下林端。\n水槛临流入，风窗捲幔看。\n鱼游迷藻荇，鸥戏悦沙滩。\n宇宙无尘翳，凉生月一团。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36967,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"复游盘山绝顶","author":"玄烨","text":"绝顶巉岩里，松烟向晓开。\n片云生众壑，虚籁落空台。\n寺古人行少，林深鸟乱回。\n千峰多秀色，远眺足徘徊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36968,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏日口外寄宫中","author":"玄烨","text":"翠盖鸾旌出，平明刻漏同。\n油云驱暑气，时雨引清风。\n山脉经年秀，泉形此日充。\n遥遥千里外，回首忆深宫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36969,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"避暑畅春园雨后新月","author":"玄烨","text":"园亭气爽雨初晴，新月胧胧透树明。\n漏下微眠思治道，未知清夜意何生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36970,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"喜雨诗十六韵","author":"玄烨","text":"体国为民事，忧勤固在斯。\n骄阳春既盛，膏泽夏愆期。\n省刑书每下，请雨令频施。\n云未油然作，风偏飒尔吹。\n芃芃苗欲槁，细细草将萎。\n翘首瞻青汉，焦心对赤墀。\n圜扉重举滞，旃厦几畴咨。\n斋祭祈神鉴，精诚只已知。\n谁云天最远，于是听能卑。\n默处敬居日，恭虔步祷时。\n微衷惭上格，大化喜潜移。\n霶霈滋南亩，飘潇遍九逵。\n叆叇阴阳协，滂沱渥泽垂。\n田家还自乐，朝野共吟诗。\n从此烦襟涤，由来百志熙。\n愿同兹砥砺，参赞奉无私。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36971,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南巡再过济南","author":"玄烨","text":"六御重经历下城，频将疾苦问苍生。\n肩摩毂击风犹在，土沃农恬世久平。\n户户春灯佳节过，村村社鼓乐郊盈。\n韶年渐布阳和泽，淑气晴光仗外横。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36972,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"观珍珠泉","author":"玄烨","text":"一泓清浅漾珠圆，细浪潆洄小荇牵。\n偶与诸臣閒倚槛，堪同鱼藻入诗篇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36973,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"经泰山之麓","author":"玄烨","text":"耸巘高峰记昔攀，春回瀑水响潺潺。\n万层石级云霄上，千里烟村缥缈间。\n暂驻犹然思往事，凭陵直欲小人寰。\n朱旗翠葆疏林外，已见巍巍俯众山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36974,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"再过淮南","author":"玄烨","text":"前来历兹境，斯民似未遂。\n今日再经过，风土觉有异。\n纨褐既充体，庐舍各完置。\n拥道欢趋迎，扶老与携稚。\n咸云获休息，近免徭役累。\n水患日就平，田畴可耕植。\n一饮与一食，莫不歌帝赐。\n素念切民依，时为劳寤寐。\n大造本无私，湛恩欲广被。\n闻言聊自宽，庶慰省方意。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36975,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"淮城晓霜闻雁","author":"玄烨","text":"天际晨光水月连，带霜归雁向前川。\n盂城晓发寒仍在，谈笑春风杂紫烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36976,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蠲江南逋赋","author":"玄烨","text":"国家财赋东南重，已责蠲租志念殷。\n膏泽何妨频见渥，普天愿与乐耕耘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36977,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过维扬","author":"玄烨","text":"重过䢴沟地，春风细草生。\n帆樯连贾舶，笙吹满江城。\n物力须教惜，民情亦见诚。\n繁华当淑景，气象喜充盈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36978,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金山江天寺","author":"玄烨","text":"独爱江天寺，停桡上碧峰。\n波澜声浩浩，楼阁势重重。\n日暖浮双树，风微送午钟。\n遥看南北岸，春色澹春容。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36979,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"焦山","author":"玄烨","text":"焦山何岝㟧，遥与金山峙。\n草木尽蒙茸，幽偏隔城市。\n放舟下中流，攀萝上涯涘。\n隐士不可招，鹤铭洵足纪。\n栖鹘惊人飞，暮云千万里。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36980,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"驻跸金山","author":"玄烨","text":"烟雾空濛水国昏，夜移凤舸泊山门。\n然犀欲照鼋鼍窟，卧听涛声自吐吞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36981,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨过锡山","author":"玄烨","text":"轻云冉冉雾弯环，细雨丝丝羃远山。\n画舫青帘开晓坐，平波漫衍白鸥閒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36982,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虎丘望山后","author":"玄烨","text":"试剑空存石，生公尚有台。\n爱看山后景，错落野田开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36983,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"邓尉小轩望太湖","author":"玄烨","text":"山轩閒坐倚前楹，万顷澄湖夕照明。\n夜久天心初月上，笙簧谡谡奏松声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36984,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登灵岩","author":"玄烨","text":"霏微灵雨散春烟，按辔逍遥陟翠巅。\n香水通流明若箭，琴台列石势如拳。\n诸峰尽在青萝外，万井全依綵仗前。\n闻是吴宫花草地，空馀钟磬梵王筵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36985,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚过吴江","author":"玄烨","text":"垂虹蜿蜒跨长波，画戟牙樯薄暮过。\n灯火千家明似昼，好风好雨祝时和。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36986,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"入平望","author":"玄烨","text":"锦缆无劳列綵艭，轻桡自爱倚船窗。\n勤民不惮周行远，早又观风向浙江。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36987,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"禾中道上","author":"玄烨","text":"两岸人家半种桑，雨中入望尽苍茫。\n民间本业惟农织，爱看山村共水乡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36988,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"巡幸杭州","author":"玄烨","text":"东南上郡古临安，亲采风谣一省观。\n翠岫巃嵷犹舞凤，羽旗简约不鸣銮。\n春晖草木江山丽，户满弦歌雨露宽。\n德化远敷吾未信，如何夹路万声欢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36989,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吴山","author":"玄烨","text":"左控长江右控湖，万家烟火满康衢。\n偶来绝顶凭虚望，似向云霄展画图。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36990,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泛舟西湖","author":"玄烨","text":"一片湖光潋滟开，峰峦三面送青来。\n轻舟棹去波添影，曲岸移时路却回。\n春色初摇堤上柳，惠风正发寺边梅。\n此行不是探名胜，欲使阳和遍九垓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36991,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西溪","author":"玄烨","text":"十里清溪曲，修篁入望深。\n暖催梅信早，水落草痕侵。\n俗藉渔为业，园饶笋作林。\n民风爱淳朴，不厌一登临。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36992,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题西溪山庄以竹窗二字书赐高士奇","author":"玄烨","text":"花源路几重，柴桑皆沃土。\n烟翠竹窗幽，雪香梅岸古。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36993,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过桃花岭至玉泉寺","author":"玄烨","text":"度岭穿云路始平，停镳聊憩小池清。\n游鱼自有悠然意，岂识乾坤造物宏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36994,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"湖心亭","author":"玄烨","text":"水上起楼台，湖面平如镜。\n春风吹柳条，远与山光映。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36995,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渡钱塘江","author":"玄烨","text":"雪后春烟漠漠浮，扬舲击楫向中流。\n江通潮汐分吴地，路入溪山隐越州。\n振武戈矛皆驻马，省方斿葆此乘舟。\n风帆沙鸟看何限，远近云霞望里收。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36996,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山阴","author":"玄烨","text":"灌木丛篁傍水幽，澹烟晴日漾芳洲。\n兰桡摇过山阴道，在昔人传镜里游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36997,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登卧龙山越望亭","author":"玄烨","text":"周览山川历井疆，越峰突兀见青苍。\n争流万壑通城郭，一一看来在下方。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":36998,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]